      </svg><span class="flip ready" style="width: 69px;"><span class="row" data-key="brand" aria-hidden="true" style="">Made with Replit</span><span class="row in" data-key="cta" aria-hidden="false">Build for free</span></span></div><button class="close-button" aria-label="Close"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="close-icon" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
